  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "subtitle",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 22,
   "text": "Privacy pulls every data class toward hiding, utility toward keeping. One policy settles each class per clearance; the pipeline enforces it with encryption.",
